---
// Work: una fila por proyecto, con la imagen alternando lado. Imagen tintada en añil con trama
// (a color al pasar el cursor o al centrarse en pantalla en táctil) y borde de tejido.
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import money from '../assets/projects/money-1.png';
import tickets from '../assets/projects/tickets-1.png';
import type { Lang } from '../i18n';
import { dict } from '../i18n';
import Weave from './Weave.astro';

interface Props {
  lang: Lang;
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const t = dict[lang];
const p = t.projects;
const shots = { money, tickets } as const;
const count = String(p.items.length).padStart(2, '0');
---

<section class="section work" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-title">
  <canvas class="dye" data-dye aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <div class="shell">
    <header class="sec-head">
      <h2 class="display" id="work-title"><span class="mask"><span>{p.title}</span></span></h2>
      <p class="label muted" data-reveal><span data-count={p.items.length}>{count}</span> {p.count}</p>
    </header>
    <ol class="work__list">
      {
        p.items.map((it) => (
          <li class="proj" id={`project-${it.slug}`}>
            <div class="proj__media" data-reveal data-tilt data-cursor="view">
              <div class="shot">
                <Weave motif="anil" lang={lang} size="frame" />
                <div class="shot__img">
                  {it.slug === 'money' || it.slug === 'tickets' ? (
                    <Image src={shots[it.slug]} alt={it.alt} widths={[640, 960, 1440]} sizes="(min-width: 900px) 58vw, 100vw" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                  ) : it.slug === 'platform' ? (
                    <div class="diagram diagram--layers" role="img" aria-label={it.alt}>
                      <p class="label diagram__cmd">$ make rebuild</p>
                      <ol>
                        {p.layers.map((l, i) => (
                          <li class="label">
                            <span>{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
                            <span>{l}</span>
                            <span class="diagram__ok">ok</span>
                          </li>
                        ))}
                      </ol>
                      <p class="label diagram__done">✓ {p.rebuild}</p>
                    </div>
                  ) : (
                    <div class="diagram diagram--path" role="img" aria-label={it.alt}>
                      <p class="label diagram__cmd">GET /{lang}/ → 200</p>
                      <ol>
                        {p.path.map((s) => (
                          <li class="label">
                            <span class="diagram__node" />
                            <span>{s}</span>
                          </li>
                        ))}
                      </ol>
                      <p class="label diagram__done">{p.pathNote}</p>
                    </div>
                  )}
                  <span class="shot__glare" aria-hidden="true" />
                </div>
                <div class="shot__pink" aria-hidden="true" />
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="proj__body">
              <p class="label muted" data-reveal data-decode>{it.year ? `${it.year} · ${it.type}` : `${it.type} · ${it.status}`}</p>
              <h3 class="display proj__name"><span class="mask"><span>{it.name}</span></span></h3>
              <p class="label accent" data-reveal>{it.role}</p>
              <p class="proj__sum muted" data-reveal>{it.summary}</p>
              <ul class="proj__tags" data-reveal>
                {it.stack.map((s) => <li class="tag label">{s}</li>)}
              </ul>
              <div class="fold" data-fold data-reveal>
                <button class="more label" type="button" data-fold-btn aria-expanded="false" aria-controls={`case-${it.slug}`} data-open={p.hide} data-closed={p.read}>
                  <span data-fold-text>{p.read}</span> <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                </button>
                <div class="fold__panel" id={`case-${it.slug}`}>
                  <ul class="proj__points">
                    {it.points.map((pt) => <li>{pt}</li>)}
                  </ul>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
